<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila Mining to raise par value to one peso.</title>
<headline>Manila Mining to raise par value to one peso.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manila Mining Corp said on Tuesday its board had approved an increase in the par value of its shares to one peso per share from one centavo.</p>
<p>Manila Mining is one of the country's biggest gold producers.</p>
<p>On Monday, its A shares closed at 1.30 centavos, up 0.10 241248centavos. Its B shares, open to foreigners, ended at 1.40 centavos, also up 0.10 centavos.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
